flowchart TD
    A[🚀 Start: Open AdminX] --> B[📊 Dashboard]
    B --> C{Choose Action}
    C -->|Quick Action| D[➕ Click 'Create Invoice']
    
    D --> E[👤 Select Customer]
    E --> F{Is Customer New?}
    F -->|Yes| G[✍️ Add New Customer<br>Name, Phone, Address]
    F -->|No| H[🔍 Search & Select]
    
    G --> I[📦 Add Items]
    H --> I
    
    I --> J{Add Product Method}
    J -->|Manual| K[🔢 Enter Name, Qty, Price]
    J -->|Barcode| L[📷 Scan Barcode]
    L --> K
    
    K --> M[🧠 AI Suggests Prices/Descriptions]
    M --> N[💰 System Auto-Calculates<br>Subtotal + GST = Grand Total]
    
    N --> O[👀 Review Invoice]
    O --> P{Action}
    P -->|Save Draft| Q[📄 Saved to Drafts]
    P -->|Finalize| R[✅ Generate Invoice PDF]
    
    R --> S[📨 Share Options]
    S --> T[💬 WhatsApp / ✉️ Email / 📱 SMS]
    T --> U[📱 Customer Receives Notification]
    U --> V[💵 Invoice Marked as 'Sent'<br>Recorded in Ledger]
    
    style R fill:#a5d6a7,stroke:#2e7d32
    style U fill:#90caf9,stroke:#1565c0